# Enforced SwiftFormat (https://github.com/nicklockwood/SwiftFormat)
# configuration for adesso mobile open source Swift packages.
#
# This file is ALWAYS used by the `swiftformat-apply.yml` reusable workflow.
# A package-level `.swiftformat` in a consuming repository has no effect and
# is ignored - see swiftformat-apply.yml for why formatting is applied via a
# scheduled PR rather than a per-package-configurable PR check.
#
# Intentionally left at SwiftFormat's built-in defaults (no rule/option
# overrides) so behavior is predictable and unsurprising.

--exclude .build,.swiftpm

# format options
--trailing-commas multi-element-lists